/** @mainpage Qore ml Module

    @tableofcontents

    @section mlintro ml Module Introduction

    <img src="ml-logo.svg" width="96" alt="ml module logo"/>

    The \c ml module provides machine learning algorithms for %Qore programs, enabling
    automated detection of anomalies, discovery of natural groupings, forecasting of future
    values, and simplification of complex data — all thread-safe and without external
    dependencies like Python.

    This module wraps the Eigen C++ linear algebra library to provide efficient, native
    implementations of common ML algorithms. Optional ONNX Runtime support allows running
    pre-trained models from frameworks like PyTorch, scikit-learn, and TensorFlow.

    @section mlqlibmodules Qore User Modules

    - @ref dataprovidermlintro "DataProviderML" — ML-based data pipeline processors wrapping the ml binary module
