    - @ref qoremodelregistryintro "QoreModelRegistry" — an ML model registry with pluggable storage backends for versioning, tagging, and deployment management
    - @ref qoreonnxtoolsintro "QoreOnnxTools" — ONNX deployment tooling helpers
    - @ref qoreonnxexportintro "QoreOnnxExport" — ONNX model export for trained ML models
    - @ref qoreragutilsintro "QoreRagUtils" — a composable RAG abstraction layer
    - @ref qoretokenizerutilsintro "QoreTokenizerUtils" — document chunking, token counting, embeddings, and re-ranking for RAG pipelines

